# {{project_name}}

An NFT Marketplace smart contract for Stellar/Soroban, generated by
[soroban-forge](https://github.com/soroban-forge-labs/soroban-forge) from the
`nft-marketplace` template.

## How it works

The marketplace facilitates trustless, escrowed sales of NFTs conforming to
the Soroban NFT template interface:

1. **Deployment & Config** — The marketplace is deployed with an `admin`, a
   `treasury` address, and a `fee_bps` protocol fee (in basis points, where
   100 bps = 1% and 10000 bps = 100%). The admin can update treasury and fee
   settings as needed.
2. **Listing an NFT** — A seller calls `list(seller, nft_contract, token_id, payment_token, price)`.
   The NFT is transferred from the seller to the marketplace contract for escrow.
3. **Buying an NFT** — A buyer calls `buy(buyer, nft_contract, token_id)`. The
   purchase price is split into the treasury fee and seller payout, transferred
   atomically, and the escrowed NFT is transferred to the buyer.
4. **Cancelling a Listing** — The seller can call `cancel(seller, nft_contract, token_id)`
   at any time prior to purchase to cancel the listing and reclaim their escrowed NFT.

## Commands

```sh
# Run unit tests
cargo test

# Build the release WASM file
stellar contract build

# Deploy to Testnet
stellar contract deploy \
  --wasm target/wasm32v1-none/release/{{crate_name}}.wasm \
  --source <your-identity> \
  --network testnet
```

